{"id":"siquiera","lemma":"siquiera","pos":"adv","rank":247,"glosses":["at least, at the least","even"],"ipa":"/siˈkjeɾa/","examples":[{"text":"Ni siquiera sabemos quién estará allí.","en":"We don't even know who's going to be there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301170","words":[{"g":"Forms an emphatic…"},null,{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"there"}]},{"text":"Ni siquiera puedo hacer eso.","en":"I can't even do that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455413","words":[{"g":"Forms an emphatic…"},null,{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]},{"text":"Ni siquiera conoces mi nombre.","en":"You don't even know my name.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/518759","words":[{"g":"Forms an emphatic…"},null,{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"name"}]},{"text":"Ni siquiera lo vi.","en":"I didn't even see it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/526855","words":[{"g":"Forms an emphatic…"},null,{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"}]},{"text":"Ni siquiera le conozco.","en":"I don't even know him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/76222","words":[{"g":"Forms an emphatic…"},null,{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"}]}]}